--[[
	PREMIUM FLY  -  standalone black + shiny neon fly GUI  (not part of MONKZ HUB)
	- Smooth flight for YOUR character only (PC: WASD + Space/E up + Q/Ctrl down + Shift boost, F = on/off,
	  RightShift = hide/show panel.  Mobile: joystick + on-screen UP / DOWN buttons)
	- Takeoff animation (shock rings, dust burst, FOV punch) and flying animation (superman lean, banking,
	  arm + leg pose, neon trails, aura)
	- Tabs: FLIGHT (orb, speed, presets, modes, cruise) and STYLE (smoothness, trail, aura, colours, sound)
	- Speed lines, flight HUD, 3 flight modes (Glide / Sport / Precise), cruise control (C), sound effects
	- Settings are saved in PremiumFly/settings.json
	Visual effects (rings / trails / aura) are client-side, so only you see them.
]]

